# Sandsunk Necropolis (CIPlay sandsunk_necropolis): the plaza at 3 m (r~24 at 0 2), the dune path from the landing in
# the south (0 -72); Kett's camp at 14 -44; the obelisk at -16 -30, the seal buried just north of it; the processional
# way x 0, z -26..-6; the tomb x -6..6, z 0..18 (antechamber z 0..9, burial chamber z 9..18), its door at 0 0.
island Sandsunk Necropolis
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Tomb of the Sea Kings
expect shown tombslab
expect shown gate
walk 0 -64 to 0 -56 to 0 -51 h=3
zone dunes
expect step 1
read Kett's dig notes
expect step 2
open Kett's dig kit
expect item MetalDetector 1
expect item Shovel 1
dig 0
expect story seal 1
expect step 3
walk 0 -24 to 0 -14 h=3
zone processional
expect step 4
use sealplinth
expect hidden tombslab
expect story seal 0
expect story sealset 1
expect step 5
walk 0 -4 to 0 -1 to 0 1.5 h=3
zone antechamber
expect step 6
kill Roach
expect step 7
read Wall of the Flood
read Wall of the Engine
read Wall of the Strait
expect step 10
walk 0 6 to 0 10 h=3 blocked
use lever
expect hidden gate
walk 0 6 to 0 8 to 0 11 h=3
zone burial_chamber
expect step 11
open Sarcophagus
expect story gear1 1
expect step 13
wait 22
expect shown gate
use hatch
zone tomb_exit
expect done
